Error: Jet.UnknownMethod: `Mat3` has no static method `zeros`
  --> Tests/UI/static_missing_core_member.jet:5:16
    |
  5 |     print(Mat3.zeros().to_array()[0])
    |                ^^^^^
 Why: Static lookup finds an associated method of `Mat3` with no `self` receiver, and `Mat3` declares none named `zeros`
 Fix: Call a static method `Mat3` declares: `new`, `identity`, `from_array`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownMethod
